{"server":"tw","storyId":"main_15_level_main_15-06_end","groupId":"main_15","stageId":"main_15-07","title":"臨界時刻","storyCode":"15-7","avgTag":"行動後","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_15-06_end.txt","sourceHash":"5adc36cf83ddb3970f29112e47deaefa22bc429002eebd79f57843ed1752c5ef","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"60_g2_rhodeslivingroom_bc"},{"type":"narration","text":"卡特斯從未覺得毀滅，尤其是能清晰感受到逼近的毀滅，是一件能夠被坦然接受的事實。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"希爾達","speakerId":"avg_npc_1719_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我、我做不到親歷所愛的一切被摧毀之後還能無動於衷。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"希爾達","speakerId":"avg_npc_1719_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我無法理解您——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"神秘的精靈","speakerId":"avg_npc_1720_1","isRemote":false,"text":"並非無動於衷，而是相信宇宙的絕對平等。可惜，你來得稍晚了一些。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"神秘的精靈","speakerId":"avg_npc_1720_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這艘艦船剛剛在數萬光年外，目睹了一次超新星爆炸，並順利逃離。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"神秘的精靈","speakerId":"avg_npc_1720_1","isRemote":false,"text":"若是你能親眼見到那個景象，或許就更能理解我的意思。"},{"type":"narration","text":"大廳內的儀器開始快速地轉動，直到卡特斯無法再用肉眼捕捉到它的軌跡。\n然後，她看到了許多浮動的光影出現。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"希爾達","speakerId":"avg_npc_1719_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我看到了一個發射暗淡深紅色光芒的巨大球體，而另一個靛藍色的小點也在球體的表面飛速掠過。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"希爾達","speakerId":"avg_npc_1719_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但是，又好像是那個很大的球體正繞著那個很小的藍點旋轉？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"神秘的精靈","speakerId":"avg_npc_1720_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你口中的藍點就是剛剛經歷了超新星爆炸的脈衝星。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"神秘的精靈","speakerId":"avg_npc_1720_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那個正逐漸被撕扯的紅色恆星曾是它的同伴，如今也正走向不可逆轉的死亡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"神秘的精靈","speakerId":"avg_npc_1720_1","isRemote":false,"text":"它們曾帶來了許多有趣的原始生命，我也十分懷念在那個星系的行星中漫步的經歷。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"神秘的精靈","speakerId":"avg_npc_1720_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可惜那些生命甚至尚未來得及看到天空之外的世界就迎來了死亡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"希爾達","speakerId":"avg_npc_1719_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……您為何要向我展示這些？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"神秘的精靈","speakerId":"avg_npc_1720_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只是在共享我們所擁有的知識，旅客。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"神秘的精靈","speakerId":"avg_npc_1720_1","isRemote":false,"text":"片面的偏執與無知往往是有效資訊傳遞的障礙之一，我對你的來歷同樣無知。"},{"type":"narration","text":"卡特斯已經無暇去理解眼前之人的話，猛然間，她所觸及的新知識開始衝擊她的思維。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"希爾達","speakerId":"avg_npc_1719_1","isRemote":false,"text":"大地……可能會誕生兩次生命？這些從天空墜下的星星……也會帶來生命？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"希爾達","speakerId":"avg_npc_1719_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“毀滅”的盡頭……並非絕望。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"希爾達","speakerId":"avg_npc_1719_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們……於那片大地而言並不特殊？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"神秘的精靈","speakerId":"avg_npc_1720_1","isRemote":false,"text":"一顆足以供養生命的星球會平等地愛著所有生活其上的生物，無論生命發源於何處。這是自然的規律。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"神秘的精靈","speakerId":"avg_npc_1720_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不要過度貪婪地汲取那些你還無法完全理解的知識。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"希爾達","speakerId":"avg_npc_1719_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我在其中也看到了您的身影，您的身邊也曾有許多同族，但突然——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"希爾達","speakerId":"avg_npc_1719_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“幽靈”，很多人這樣稱呼您，對吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幽靈","speakerId":"avg_npc_1720_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我的確只是一個遊蕩的幽靈。如我所言，當真正的毀滅降臨於我和我的同族面前時，我也無能為力。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"希爾達","speakerId":"avg_npc_1719_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……您所說的毀滅到底是什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"希爾達","speakerId":"avg_npc_1719_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我已經在這裡看到了太多分明是神明才能實現的手段，到底是怎樣的毀滅才能威脅到你們？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幽靈","speakerId":"avg_npc_1720_1","isRemote":false,"text":"旅客，你的問題，恐怕這艘船上無人能夠回答。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幽靈","speakerId":"avg_npc_1720_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哪怕在你的眼中，我們所擁有的知識足以被寰宇中眾多的生命視作“神明的手段”……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幽靈","speakerId":"avg_npc_1720_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但宇宙之浩瀚，我們所能探索的領域也同樣存在極限。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"希爾達","speakerId":"avg_npc_1719_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幽靈","speakerId":"avg_npc_1720_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你很失落？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"希爾達","speakerId":"avg_npc_1719_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以絕不可能存在一個永恆的國度，一個人人都能獲得無盡幸福和快樂的樂園？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幽靈","speakerId":"avg_npc_1720_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你希望這樣的國度存在嗎？"},{"type":"narration","text":"卡特斯猶豫片刻後，點了點頭。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幽靈","speakerId":"avg_npc_1720_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沒有生靈是永恆的。我所熟知的歷史中，也有過傳奇的文明征服了千萬個星系，他們在宇宙中漫步的時光跨越百萬年之久。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幽靈","speakerId":"avg_npc_1720_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可於宇宙而言，他們留下的痕跡終究還是渺小不堪。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幽靈","speakerId":"avg_npc_1720_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們都曾迷失在盲目追求不存在的信條與理想的……不可追憶的黃金時代中，我們都堅信自我的存在有著絕對的目的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幽靈","speakerId":"avg_npc_1720_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但最終呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"希爾達","speakerId":"avg_npc_1719_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幽靈","speakerId":"avg_npc_1720_1","isRemote":false,"text":"任何一個誕生靈智的生命都曾執著於宣揚自我為所處世界的中心，但是否有可能，對宇宙而言——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幽靈","speakerId":"avg_npc_1720_1","isRemote":false,"text":"自始至終，我們無足輕重。這才是瞭解宇宙之前所必須學會的第一課。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幽靈","speakerId":"avg_npc_1720_1","isRemote":false,"text":"記得你剛剛所見的那場絢麗的超新星爆發嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幽靈","speakerId":"avg_npc_1720_1","isRemote":false,"text":"生命終會在墳墓中再次誕生，而終有一天，他們會理解我們在墓碑上刻下的印記。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幽靈","speakerId":"avg_npc_1720_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那是我們曾經擁有的生活。我們存在過。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"希爾達","speakerId":"avg_npc_1719_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……我無法理解您的話。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"希爾達","speakerId":"avg_npc_1719_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那我們是如何在那片大地上誕生的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"希爾達","speakerId":"avg_npc_1719_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在我們之前，是否也曾誕生過更加輝煌的文明？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"希爾達","speakerId":"avg_npc_1719_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而我們是否也會在目所能及的未來迎接毀滅？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"希爾達","speakerId":"avg_npc_1719_1","isRemote":false,"text":"還有我更在意的，源石所帶來的疾病與痛苦，是否也能得到根除？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"希爾達","speakerId":"avg_npc_1719_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我請求您指引我找到通往這些知識的道路……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幽靈","speakerId":"avg_npc_1720_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我無法回答你任何一個問題。你的前三個問題在宇宙中有著不同語言的不同版本，它們只能由你們自身回答。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幽靈","speakerId":"avg_npc_1720_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而最後一個問題……很抱歉，我從未聽說過“源石”，也並未從已有的資料庫中搜尋到任何與“源石”相關的資訊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"希爾達","speakerId":"avg_npc_1719_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幽靈","speakerId":"avg_npc_1720_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不過，我認識一位有趣的人，也是這艘艦船的主人。或許她能解答你的疑惑。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"希爾達","speakerId":"avg_npc_1719_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這艘艦船的主人？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幽靈","speakerId":"avg_npc_1720_1","isRemote":false,"text":"也是一位聲名遠揚的語言學家，她叫——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"“普瑞賽斯”。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"60_g6_crownboundary"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"博士，現在不是發呆的時候！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"抓緊我！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"——！","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"阿米婭，你看到了嗎？","value":"2","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我暫時不敢分心，編織一條通向奇點的道路很困難。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哪怕有特蕾西婭小姐的協助……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"博士，你看到了什麼！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"……","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"narration","text":"你看到了一個熟悉的身影。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"……","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"60_g6_crownboundary"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"不必分心，阿米婭。","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"執行我們原本的計劃。","value":"2","blocks":[]},{"label":"繼續搭建這座“橋”！","value":"3","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好！我正在努力穩定每一個連接點，博士。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"凱爾希醫生之前搜尋的每一項記錄都被特蕾西婭小姐標記了出來，我正試圖將它們串聯起來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但我還需要一個錨點，一個能夠指引我返回的錨點——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魔王","speakerId":"avg_4134_cetsyr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我會於此守望，我會成為你的錨點。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魔王","speakerId":"avg_4134_cetsyr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"繼續前進吧，阿米婭。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"粉紅色的絲線開始聚集。\n蜿蜒的線條交織盤旋，逐漸從邊界開始向更遠處延伸。\n超越邊界，通往奇點的通路正逐漸形成。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"成功了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"雖然源石技藝在這裡似乎並不奏效，但是藉由源石技藝的施術邏輯來重構這裡出現的資訊是可行的！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"你可以做到呼叫完全未知的資訊搭建“橋”？","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"不行，這裡充斥著我無法解析，甚至連“文明的存續”都無法替我轉譯的資訊，完全依靠我自己無法構建通路。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"但好在凱爾希醫生的存取留下了記錄，她的研究數據在特蕾西婭小姐的協助下能夠被我捕捉到。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"這就足夠了。"},{"type":"narration","text":"粉紅色的絲線緩慢地盤旋串聯起諸多龐雜的數據，那是凱爾希留下的足跡。\n由一絲到千絲萬縷，道路正逐漸浮現。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"構建通路的效率不高，但應該能奏效。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我想嘗試進入通路，嘗試向奇點靠近。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"我陪你一起。","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"不，博士，我不會允許你在我尚未探明情況的前提下貿然進入通路。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"阿米婭……","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"原諒我的堅持，但這就是我的決定。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"千絲萬縷的資訊所構建的通路已經遠遠延伸到了奇點。\n阿米婭毫不猶豫地踏上了通路，她第一次涉足了邊界之外——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"浪湧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"……？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"這種感覺，就好像這些資訊形成了實質的浪湧一樣，怎麼會——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"恐怕這只是開始。","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"“越靠近奇點，資訊的密度會越高”……","value":"2","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"果然如特蕾西婭小姐所言，這裡的資訊已經足以產生質量。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"繼續深入應該會受到更大的阻礙。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"阿米婭，先撤回來。","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"我們需要考慮更好的應對方法。","value":"2","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我沒辦法保證穩定住這條脆弱的通路，深入其中的消耗遠比我預期的要更大。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我必須繼續向前，只要沿著凱爾希醫生留下的那些信標……"},{"type":"narration","text":"提卡茲走入的銀色山脈從她的身邊掠過，墜入冰原的巨獸投下的漆黑陰影轉瞬即逝。\n阿米婭所看到的畫面仍在快速從她的身邊掠過，彷彿她正逆向蹚著時間的河流向前。\n越來越多她無法理解，無法描述的畫面衝擊著她的思維。\n她努力封鎖那些無邊無際卻又混亂不堪的資訊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"集中注意力，集中注意力，只需要注視著凱爾希醫生留下的信標……前進……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"只要能觸碰到奇點——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"無聲的寂靜。\n阿米婭甚至無法聽到自己呼吸的聲音。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"——？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"這是……什麼地方？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"那個巨大的球體……在碎裂？"},{"type":"narration","text":"崩解的球體讓她感到眩目，而那艘飄浮在空中的奇異形狀的艦船更是讓她恍了恍神。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"到底……發生了什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"為什麼我會看到——"},{"type":"narration","text":"而就在她恍神之際，一顆轉動的巨石以一種緩慢卻不可阻擋的趨勢向阿米婭逼近。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"——！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"黑色的陰影迅速遮擋了阿米婭的全部視線，她下意識地試圖保護自己，但隨即而來的卻是無法控制的墜落感。\n失敗了嗎……是資訊的浪湧嗎？\n“阿米婭！”"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"……博士……？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"我在。","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"narration","text":"阿米婭感覺到有一隻手扶住了自己，支撐著自己的思維保持穩定。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"試著封鎖那些干擾我們的資訊。","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"我和你一起。","value":"2","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"希望我來得不算晚。","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"抱歉沒能乖乖聽你的話，阿米婭。","value":"2","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"博士……太好了……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"剛剛那一瞬間……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"你竭力支撐阿米婭搖晃的身體，自奇點噴發而出的資訊浪湧依舊不斷衝擊著你們。\n近乎形成實體的資訊沖刷過你們的思維，在虛空中留下了混雜不清的殘影——\n那是已然逝去的過去，是被龐大資訊記錄的當下，也似乎是預知了你們下一步行動的未來。\n可惜眼下，你們並沒有多餘的精力再去關注這些。\n從這裡回望邊界，你們已經不知不覺在通路上前行了很遠，而奇點……\n奇點近在眼前。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"博士，你看到剛才那個恐怖的景象了嗎？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"看到了。","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"我無法分辨其中的含義。","value":"2","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我十分肯定那不是發生在泰拉的景象……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"但至少這意味著我們的確正在接近奇點。","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"更多的資訊正在向我們開放。","value":"2","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"你還撐得住嗎，阿米婭？","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"當、當然。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"……","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"narration","text":"你很清楚你們如今的處境，儘管你知道這樣可能收效甚微，但你還是下意識地伸出手，試圖擋在阿米婭的前面。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"這裡的衝擊更多針對思維，我能應付。","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"我走前面。","value":"2","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"關於我們要找的關鍵，我有了線索。","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"我收集並演算了凱爾希留下的存取記錄。","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"直接從我的思維裡讀取關鍵資訊。","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"找到了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"以關鍵字“安眠橋”為篩選條件，凱爾希醫生進行了共計七萬九千三百四十六次搜尋……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"雖然所有的搜尋都與“源石”有關，但按照博士你的推測，這些數據都與源石的本質並無太大關聯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"如果結果都是拒絕存取而毫無收穫，線索豈不是完全中斷了？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"並非如此。","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"凱爾希會重複搜尋同一個條目多次。","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"這本身就是在向我們傳遞某種資訊。","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"重複搜尋？等等，重複的搜尋次數組成的無限循環的代碼也能夠被解密？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"……博士，你已經解出了答案。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"是的，一個熟悉的名字。","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"或許是一個指示……","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"或許是一個警告……","value":"2","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我從未聽說過這個名字，無論是你還是凱爾希醫生，都從來沒有說起過——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"“普瑞賽斯”？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_white"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"——博士，我們看到的是同一個畫面嗎？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"……恐怕，是的……","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"narration","text":"“普瑞賽斯……”\n你從未見過這個畫面，更沒有見過——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"普瑞賽斯","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"（未知語言）你來了，{@nickname}。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"那是……？","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"“我”……？","value":"2","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"預言家","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"（未知語言）改進你設計出來的PRTS花了點時間。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"預言家","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"（未知語言）我以為你去休息了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"普瑞賽斯","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"（未知語言）不，我一直在想你剛剛說的話。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"普瑞賽斯","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"（未知語言）“不存在描述神的語言，因為神本身的存在是絕對不可理解的。”"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"預言家","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"（未知語言）你很清楚那只是我們漫無目的聊天時的隨口之言。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"普瑞賽斯","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"（未知語言）如果我假設這是一個正確的前提。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"普瑞賽斯","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"（未知語言）以此為出發點，創造一種足夠描述神的語言，是否也意味著神能夠被我們理解？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"普瑞賽斯","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"（未知語言）難道你不為此而激動嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"普瑞賽斯","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"（未知語言）也許我們為了找到那個問題的答案，一直都走在了錯誤的道路上——試圖藉助宇宙已經誕生的規則去解讀宇宙的本質。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"預言家","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"（未知語言）你想用完全由我們所創造的語言去解釋宇宙。一個過於大膽的設想，普瑞賽斯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"普瑞賽斯","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"（未知語言）哈哈，是嗎？"},{"type":"narration","text":"她乾脆俐落地用手指在空中畫出一個無比標準的菱形。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"普瑞賽斯","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"（未知語言）那乾脆就從現在開始，如何？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"……","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"博士，他們在討論什麼？"},{"type":"narration","text":"你早已見過眼前之人，在內化宇宙中，她曾陪伴在你的身旁——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"……","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"恐怕他們討論的是……","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"源石。","value":"1","blocks":[]}]}],"observedOperators":[]}
